          <h3>Engineering globally relevant systems from a small Mediterranean island.</h3>

          <p>
            Aleph Innovation starts from a simple premise: advanced engineering
            does not need to originate from a large technology hub. What matters
            is the quality of the architecture, the discipline of the
            implementation and the ability to test what a system actually does.
          </p>

          <p>
            Gozo is our operating context and part of our identity, while the
            systems we build are conceived for international application.
          </p>
